1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:02,610
Uh... w-well...

2
00:00:03,843 --> 00:00:05,113
Okay, look, I-I don't
want to lie to you.

3
00:00:05,112 --> 00:00:07,682
I-I got curious,
I was looking around...

4
00:00:07,681 --> 00:00:10,251
(Raj:)and I broke the drawer
on your night stand.

5
00:00:10,251 --> 00:00:12,181
(Emily:)You were looking
in my night stand?

6
00:00:12,186 --> 00:00:13,516
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

7
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:15,390
(Emily:)So, the first time
I leave you alone,

8
00:00:15,389 --> 00:00:17,219
(Emily:)you snoop on me?

9
00:00:17,224 --> 00:00:20,094
(Raj:)You've never snooped
around my apartment?

10
00:00:20,094 --> 00:00:23,024
No!
Come on, think back.

11
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:26,300
It would really help if you had!

12
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:28,030
EMILY: I can't believe
you don't trust me!

13
00:00:28,035 --> 00:00:31,065
(Bernadette:)She sounds really mad.

14
00:00:31,071 --> 00:00:33,071
(Howard:)We should hang up.

15
00:00:33,073 --> 00:00:34,773
(Bernadette:)Yeah, we should.

16
00:00:34,775 --> 00:00:36,405
(Howard:)But we're not
going to, are we?

17
00:00:36,410 --> 00:00:38,980
(Bernadette:)Not a chance.

18
00:00:38,979 --> 00:00:41,309
(Howard:)What happened to
"snooping is wrong"?

19
00:00:41,315 --> 00:00:43,315
(Bernadette:)Howard, you're going
to jail for tax fraud.

20
00:00:43,317 --> 00:00:45,887
(Bernadette:)Who cares?

21
00:00:47,186 --> 00:00:48,786
(Leonard:)Well, we did it.

22
00:00:48,789 --> 00:00:52,559
(Penny:)We sure did.

23
00:00:52,559 --> 00:00:53,889
I mean, I was on fire!

24
00:00:53,894 --> 00:00:56,224
I-I was in the zone,
like an athlete.

25
00:00:56,230 --> 00:00:58,730
(Penny:)Sweetie, I beat
you at this, too.

26
00:00:58,732 --> 00:01:01,022
(Leonard:)So, where do we
want to hang it?

